  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 59d457f7b7cfc4e47970b95b99339463, type: 3}
  m_Name: Minstrel
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Minstrel
  name: Minstrel
  IdleReplices:
  - I always thought I'd die because of a woman... and I did... but I never expected
    my second death to be because of you.
  - "Hey hey! Wait wait! Don\u2019t kill me! I can sing! I can dance! Just don\u2019t
    throw me in there!"
  - "Life is cruel... but this is just unfair, don\u2019t you think?"
  - "I\u2019ve talked my way out of life once already... maybe I can do it again?"
  - Death is fine, but could it at least be less hot?
  HoverReplices:
  - "That woman\u2026 she\u2019s the one who dragged you into this, right? Yeah\u2026
    makes sense."
  - "I just need one good story and I\u2019m out of this mess, right?"
  - Whose heart did I break so badly that even heaven wants me gone?
  DragReplices:
  - "N-no, no, no! You can\u2019t do this to me! How is this fair?!"
  - "Wait! Wait! Let\u2019s talk this out! I can explain everything!"
  - "Please, I\u2019m begging you! I still have so many unfinished stories!"
  PutInReplices:
  - "Don\u2019t\u2014 don\u2019t do this! I was just joking! I always joke!"
  bonusDescription: 
  returnChance: 0.4
